d-7b31-5dd8-b6f1-2decc2199d54" :question/math-academy-id "q-36244" :question/problem "To which of the following sets do all the real numbers belong?\n\n- ${Z}^{-}$\n- $N$\n- $Q$\n- ${Q}^{-}$" :question/worked-solution "- The set ${Z}^{-}$ contains all the negative integer numbers. However, real numbers as, for instance, $\\sqrt{2}$ don't belong to ${Z}^{-},$ so ${Z}^{-}$ does *not* contain the real numbers. $\\,\\times $\n\n- The set $N$ contains all the natural numbers. However, real numbers as, for instance, $\\sqrt{2}$ don't belong to $N,$ so $N$ does *not* contain the real numbers. $\\,\\times $\n\n- The set $Q$ contains all the rational numbers. However, real numbers as, for instance, $\\sqrt{2}$ don't belong to $Q,$ so $Q$ does *not* contain the real numbers. $\\,\\times $\n\n- The set ${Q}^{-}$ contains all the negative rational numbers. However, real numbers as, for instance, $\\sqrt{2}$ don't belong to ${Q}^{-},$ so ${Q}^{-}$ does *not* contain the real numbers. $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-36244/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d132801-b9cc-5c0c-a8fa-0c8b840c05bd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-36244"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-37315/selection/b733e7a470ea14913327e50fae585d7231209b41e08de1ba47b5dbb3c5f7d7d6" :answer/id #uuid "60b27d02-4378-5a4b-b024-ea3696750f8f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "IV only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37315/selection/ba40c3d281ebccbd62feb906e1fcb0e0a5b4e21d2bc2d4d70b2b91f49c65537f" :answer/id #uuid "457c934b-cfcc-5e59-a088-f8e4d940fdb2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, III, and IV" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37315/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "e0e6d741-a13a-5171-9429-f7af709dc1a2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/valu